# Product Evolution Log: CG AI Screenshot Translator

## [2026-08-11] - Stage 01 (UI/UX) Evolution Iteration Completed
- **Version**: v0.1.1 (Towards v0.2.0)
- **Agent Role**: Core Engineering Subagent (agy worker)
- **Status**: Stage 01 Completed (10/10 Gates Verified)
- **Git Commit Target**: `feat(ux): stage 01 ui-ux polish with crosshairs, adaptive cards, and f4 quick capture`
- **Key Enhancements Implemented**:
  1. **Dynamic Crosshair Guidelines & Real-Time Coordinate HUD**: Added subtle full-screen dashed crosshairs tracking cursor + live `(X, Y)` coordinate badge during selection phase for precision 3D UI region cropping.
  2. **Adaptive Typography & Font Scaling Engine**: Dynamic font-size (10px~22px) and flexible minimum bounding box for long translation phrases with truncation prevention.
  3. **Rich Micro-Toolbar on Translation Cards**: Hovering on overlay cards reveals quick actions (📋 Copy single block with visual checkmark, 🔊 TTS Speech, 📌 Pin toggle, and translation source badge).
  4. **Global F4 Quick Capture & Exit**: Single-key F4 support for instant screen capture overlay toggle and clean exit.
  5. **Animated Feedback Toast System**: Seamless floating toasts for card pin toggle, clipboard copying, and language switching.
  6. **Design System & Elevation Styling**: Fine-tuned frosted glass borders, glowing amber pin rings, and fluid CSS keyframe animations in `index.css`.
- **Ten-Gate Verification**:
  - Gate 1 (Build check): PASSED
  - Gate 2 (Static check / Linter): PASSED
  - Gate 3 (Unit tests): PASSED (100% test suite compatibility)
  - Gate 4 (Format check): PASSED
  - Gate 5 (Visual verification): PASSED (WCAG AA 4.5:1 contrast, Fluent design compliant)
  - Gate 6 (Basic function regression): PASSED
  - Gate 7 (No regression): PASSED (All 10 core features functional)
  - Gate 8 (Clean log / no console error): PASSED
  - Gate 9 (Diff review): PASSED
  - Gate 10 (Git commit): Committed

